// Waterworld — the second realm.
//
// Not a new program: the same realm code as the canyon, deployed as its own
// canister with its own state. Its zones are isles and shallows, its dungeons
// its own, its people its own — but every rule, every price and every door
// works the way the canyon's does, and the same Keeper pays both. What makes
// it interesting is precisely that nothing had to change: worlds are cheap
// now, and the Wayhouse will carry a character to any of them.
//
// The implementation lives in a private repository until launch.
